nference on Software Engineering\\n\",\"source_role\":\"document\",\"source_message_indices\":[]},{\"id\":\"s22\",\"doc_id\":\"d2\",\"start\":725,\"end\":1056,\"text\":\"(ICSE)® will be considered to be a duplicate submission\\nand rejected by that conference with no regard to the paper's scientific merit if there is\\nsubstantial overlap in the technical content of the conference submission and any other work\\nthat is:\\nunder review at another publication,\\nhas been accepted by another publication, or\\n\",\"source_role\":\"document\",\"source_message_indices\":[]},{\"id\":\"s23\",\"doc_id\":\"d2\",\"start\":1056,\"end\":1389,\"text\":\"has appeared in another publication, at any time before the conference\\nreview process is complete.\\nIn this context, a \\\"publication\\\" is any peer-reviewed scientific\\narchive such as a conference, journal, or technical book. The determination of substantial\\noverlap in the technical content will be made by the program committee chairs.\",\"source_role\":\"document\",\"source_message_indices\":[]}],\"evidence_obligations\":[{\"id\":\"obligation_10adbef0efdfbb0e21b2f531\",\"variable\":\"agreement_location\",\"entity_scope\":\"ICSE duplicate submission statement\",\"time_scope\":\"agreement time\",\"source_ids\":[\"s19\"],\"descriptions\":[\"The source document lists 'ICSE Duplicate Submission Statement' as a document link under 'Other useful documents' on the ICSE organizational page, but provides no text, date, or location of agreement for that statement. The page itself is about ICSE organization and contains an MOU and operating rules, but the duplicate submission statement is merely referenced as a separate document without any details about where or when it was agreed upon.\"],\"origins\":[\"7857380896383e0e88d4a9f02be4d6ce971f33c0fc4af2873afed92ae406bf87\"]}],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"ICSE duplicate submission statement\",\"time_scope\":\"agreement time\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported